# Commit as the project evolves

This repo lives at https://github.com/Martinskgl/lecobiaggioni. After a meaningful slice of work, create a git commit and push to `origin/main`. Do not wait to be asked.

- One concern per commit (layout, copy, animation, infra)
- Message explains **why** the change exists, in 1–2 sentences
- Never dump unrelated UI, copy, and config into one commit
- Do not commit `.env`, `.vercel`, or secrets
- After a site-facing change, deploy to Vercel as well (see deploy-on-finish)

```bash
git add <files-for-this-slice>
git commit -m "Why this change exists."
git push origin main
```
